MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

1296 (Viktor 10.10.2026: «По LoRA расхождение в списке и в missing на Големе в Студии»): in Engine → Models and LoRAs a part whose odd file is one's own copy of a published LoRA («differs», kept by fetch-ruach-loras.py) counts whole, its row says why it was kept, and the part's line says «own copies kept: N» in all seven languages.

1297 (Viktor 10.10.2026, his laptop's 16 GB card: «вечно "ждёт генерации"… реальный лог и сообщение о том, что модель выбранная не потянет на этом железе, не видно»): an artwork that waits for a card says why in its toast (the guard's words: the card's memory and the need), then that it starts by itself; a failed one says «No artwork:» once, not twice; a painter the lab refuses at once (no card here can hold it) ends a volley of artworks at the first take instead of the same refusal for each (HeresyArt.many).

1298 (Viktor 10.10.2026: «В Тренере - The LOG перекрывает серверный фрейм. Сделай утяжку, тем более что он не нужен такой длинный для коротких строк лога/телеметрии»): a run's log at the Trainer's foot is as wide as its lines and stops short of the server log's dock, on whichever side the dock stands (a ResizeObserver and a MutationObserver follow the dock), on the dock's baseline; in a window too narrow for both it takes the width as before; another room does not show it.

1299 (Viktor 10.10.2026: «Добавь также возможность выстраивать в одну колонку оба блока живого графа. Сейчас они оба NAR и AR в одной полосе»): a button beside «The log» stacks the Telemetry's two curves one under the other, each the whole width, or puts them side by side again (Lucide's rows-2 and cols-2 show what a click makes); remembered in this browser (yue2.trStacked).

Suite: 540/0 in the kitchen; its time guard 240 → 330 s.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
